{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-04_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-04","title":"不要恐慌","storyCode":"4-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"7f82a5ee2eacc0cfe36055a15282909f4afd8299fa7ba64a9aaabef66b2b78e4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"被發現後，隕星小隊試圖反擊，卻被梅菲斯特無情壓制，並且雪怪小隊也在靠近。\n危急之下，霜葉向阿米婭發出警告——不要來。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......可惡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"總算......解決了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"那些空中飄蕩下來的粉塵......是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕，咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好疼......好疼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......啊啊！好癢，好癢！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅......羅德島！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敵人......敵人！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"什......！怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才被打倒的整合運動又站起來了——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？不行了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"光芒，從那個傢伙的法杖裡......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我可還沒有動手哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......還有更多敵人增援....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，只能依賴這一發弩彈能把敵人的首領......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......這種情況下，你們還有討論的餘裕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"真自信啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，就讓這發弩彈教教你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不，隕星。不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......！為什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"快撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是他們。他們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不射擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，你們就沒機會了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"他要撤退了？可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"隕星！射擊西側那棟危樓，快！至少可以分散敵人的注意力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......只能這樣了！沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，跑起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......雪怪們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"................走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......潔西卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"她說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"我們快走......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，聽得見嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！我掩護你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"——不要來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"這個廢城分城是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["隕星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["潔西卡"]}]}
